- Yeah.

00:21:10.935 --> 00:21:12.404 align:start size:78% position:22%
That's really impressive.

00:21:12.437 --> 00:21:13.738 align:start size:69% position:31%
Sorry for the hold up.

00:21:13.771 --> 00:21:15.740 align:start size:75% position:25%
